<section class="graph-demo" aria-labelledby="graph-title"><h2 id="graph-title">样本路径教学示意</h2><p>简化的示意序列：两个虚构样本共享 A、D，中间分别经过 B 或 C。连线表示图中的允许连接；真实图的路径、节点方向和变异类型需要由输入及构图流程确定。</p><div class="graph-stage"><svg viewBox="0 0 720 230" role="img" aria-label="两条样本路径通过同一泛基因组图"><title>两条样本路径通过同一泛基因组图</title><path d="M140 115 H225 L310 55 H435 L525 115 H600" fill="none" stroke="#d3e0e3" stroke-width="9"/><path d="M140 115 H225 L310 175 H435 L525 115 H600" fill="none" stroke="#d3e0e3" stroke-width="9"/><path id="sample-a" d="M140 115 H225 L310 55 H435 L525 115 H600" fill="none" stroke="#197b73" stroke-width="5"/><path id="sample-b" d="M140 115 H225 L310 175 H435 L525 115 H600" fill="none" stroke="#346f9c" stroke-width="5"/><g fill="#fff" stroke="#17324d" stroke-width="2"><rect x="40" y="90" width="100" height="50" rx="8"/><rect x="310" y="30" width="125" height="50" rx="8"/><rect x="310" y="150" width="125" height="50" rx="8"/><rect x="600" y="90" width="80" height="50" rx="8"/></g><g fill="#17324d" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle"><text x="90" y="121">A</text><text x="372" y="61">B</text><text x="372" y="181">C</text><text x="640" y="121">D</text></g></svg></div><p id="graph-explanation" aria-live="polite">共同图包含两条输入路径：样本甲 A–B–D，样本乙 A–C–D。</p><div><button type="button" data-sample="both" aria-pressed="true">显示两条路径</button> <button type="button" data-sample="a" aria-pressed="false">样本甲</button> <button type="button" data-sample="b" aria-pressed="false">样本乙</button> <button type="button" data-sample="reset">重置</button></div><p>绿色和蓝色分别表示不同输入路径；色彩之外也可通过按钮及文字识别样本。此图不进行序列比对或真实变异识别。</p></section>
<script>
const graphLabels:Record<string,string>={both:'共同图包含两条输入路径：样本甲 A–B–D，样本乙 A–C–D。',a:'样本甲路径：A–B–D。B 是该路径中的示意序列片段。',b:'样本乙路径：A–C–D。C 是该路径中的示意序列片段。'};
for(const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-sample]'))button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const choice=button.dataset.sample==='reset'?'both':button.dataset.sample!;document.querySelector('#sample-a')?.setAttribute('opacity',choice==='b'?'0.08':'1');document.querySelector('#sample-b')?.setAttribute('opacity',choice==='a'?'0.08':'1');const text=document.querySelector('#graph-explanation');if(text)text.textContent=graphLabels[choice];for(const item of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-sample]'))if(item.dataset.sample!=='reset')item.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(item.dataset.sample===choice));});
</script>
<style>.graph-demo{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#f8fbfa;border-radius:12px;margin:32px 0}.graph-stage{overflow-x:auto}.graph-stage svg{width:100%;min-width:620px;height:auto}.graph-demo button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--teal);color:white}.graph-demo p{font-size:.9rem}.graph-demo button{margin:4px}</style>
